  (fn-do + is-rerun Bool
    (param instance InstanceId)
    ; Whether an instance is the function a live action runs a live statement again with, tests
    ; a `whenever` clause again with, selects the arm of a markup branch region again with, or
    ; reads the container of a markup loop region again with.
