  (fn-do + target-ids-of (list U32)
    (param level TypeId)
    ; The targets of descendant queries a constructor registers an object of the class `level` for
    ; (`QueryRegistration`): each the class is or is below, as the type pass numbers them from 1
    ; (`Facts.query-targets`), from all it numbered.
